   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>There are three digits in base 4: 0, 1, 2, 3. Fill in your table headers.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Add what you can that does not use more than those digits.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+</b></td>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For the rest, you need to use base 4 math.</p>\n<p>1 + 3 in base 10 is 4. To write this in base 4, you need to use the four’s place: 10.</p>\n<p>2 + 2 in base 10 is 4. That will also be 10 in base 4.</p>\n<p>3 + 1 in base 10 is 4. That will also be 10 in base 4.</p>\n<p>Write 10 in those three cells.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+</b></td>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>2 + 3 in base 10 is 5. To write this in base 4, you need one 4 and one 1. That is 11 in base 4.</p>\n<p>3 + 2 in base 10 is 5. That will also be 11 in base 4.</p>\n<p>Write 11 in those cells.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+</b></td>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>3 + 3 = 6 in base 10. To write this in base 4, you need one 4 and two 1s. That is 12 in base 4.</p>\n<p>Write 12 in that cell.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+</b></td>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>0</b></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>12</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<table summary=\".\">\n<caption>Base 4 Addition Table</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>12</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    }
